=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# backup verify ------------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Mock: Verify Directory (3) on the default, elsewhere, unsafe$
# and relative hosts, each report under the screen's prompt;$
# nothing written.$
$
# verify on default --------------------------------------------$
$
  Only root can change /var/backups, where the first backup$
  makes /var/backups/hardn. Nothing was written.$
$
# verify on elsewhere ------------------------------------------$
$
  Only root can change /srv/backups/hardn. Nothing was written.$
$
# verify on unsafe ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Warning$
# Others can change /tmp, so backups can't go in /tmp/hardn-$
# backups. Choose a directory only root can change.$
$
  Nothing was written.$
$
# verify on relative -------------------------------------------$
$
# Warning$
# "backups" is not an absolute path. Start it with /.$
$
  Nothing was written.$
$
$

